Wrong.  Statues and figurines are different items.  You may be
right that cursed statues will animate; i never check cursed status of
statues, you're right they're heavy.  Certainly some statues aren't
really statues ("you find a water nymph posing as a statue", etc).  

figurines, when applied, will create the monsster they're named 
after in the square you apply them into (make sure this is an empty
square).  I know that blessed ones make tame monsters, and cursed
ones make non-tame monsters.  It's not clear to me how often you 
get a pet from an uncursed figurine; i do think it's happened to me
but i could be wrong.  

